# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: Relation and Function are disjoint.
#
# An assignment ties a function to a resource and is neither of them. The
# axiom is what keeps the three main classes apart, which is what the whole
# alignment is arranged around.
@prefix aias:     <https://w3id.org/aias#> .
@prefix vdi3682:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/vdi3682#> .
@prefix iso7498:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#> .
@prefix iso22989: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#> .
@prefix ex:       <https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg#> .
@prefix owl:      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/neg03> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/2.0.0> .
ex:Thing3 a aias:Relation , aias:Function .
